             :intent "Once any contract on a branch names a schema the agent registered, my.test/check fails every test on the branch with :malli.core/invalid-schema {:schema :notes-index/note}: the check world's fork (fork-cluster-ctx via clean-request-handle -> install-function-contract!) builds contracts against a projection without the branch's schemas, while the install gate uses the right one. 1.6-3.2 s, once 17.3 s."
             :must-read #{seon.sci.eval/install-function-contract! seon.test/clean-request-handle}
             :evidence #{"docs/research/agent-platform/dogfood-author-opus-2026-09-26.md"
